    "used_clause_literal": "3. For each component $j$, traverse its undercrossings in order and form\n   $W_j=\\prod_c (Y_{o(c)}^{(d)})^{\\epsilon_c}$, where the factors are in\n   traversal order and $\\epsilon_c=+1$ for source-to-target and $-1$ for\n   target-to-source. In string-link mode set $\\Lambda_j=W_j$. In closed-link\n   mode set\n   $$\\Lambda_j=(1+X_j)^{-\\operatorname{wr}_j(D)}W_j,$$\n   where $\\operatorname{wr}_j(D)$ is the sum of the determinant signs at\n   self-crossings of component $j$.",
